h motivation for it and  sometimes I kind of feel like I want to  make something but it just doesn't  really happen that well and I think many  people can you know share this feeling  but generally speaking I think the more  inspired you are the more you're also  motivated to make some things but I'll  come back to this later on because I  think both inspiration and expectation  and you know having patience as well  they all turn into motivation think the  most important points for motivation is  that you have a certain goal that you  want to strive toward it can be the  inspiration that you've seen from  something else that you want to make  something like that it can be be  planning or the ideas that you wanna you  wanna make and it can be anything else  like just you know getting yourself to  do something in this game and actually  achieving something in which case a very  strange way for myself to sometimes get  motivation is sometimes I just find  myself going you know through social  media all the time and not really  achieving anything and then it's two  hours later and I'm still browsing my  Facebook feed and I'm like yeah what the  hell did I just do I just wasted all  that time and  you know while it seems like sometimes  I'm not really motivated to play planet  coach because I try to avoid it as much  as I can at some periods of time when  actually get to it when I actually get  the motivation and start doing it it  just feels better than wasting my time  on Facebook feeds and you know actually  building something it feels bit more  like you're actually doing something  even though just playing a game and  that's how it's more or less always felt  for me since playing these games who  knows little but yeah that's why I  decided recently to shut down my  internet sometimes when I'm playing the  game just completely shut it down and  ignore any kind of social medium and  anybody who's trying to talk for me talk  with me because now I'm playing planet  coaster for a few hours and I think  sometimes that's just quite motivating  for me personally but then again I also  have to say you know motivation is quite  a personal thing like what gets you  motivated kind of depends really depends  on what you're looking toward and what  you want to achieve oh if that sounds  really official you know it's just a  game in the end but for me personally I  think it's kind of important because I  don't want to push myself too much but I  do find that when I'm motivated to  actually do something even though it  seemed at first that I didn't want to  play planet coaster  it just is more fun in the end than  whatever I was doing to procrastinate  though procrastination is a completely  different topic that I won't get into in  this video because it's a terrible thing  that I don't want to remind myself of  again anyway moving on to expectation  which really ties into motivation for me  personally because well not just for me  personally I think it's a it's ties into  motivation quite well and more than  people normally think of because one  thing that gets me going that gets me  motivated is having an idea of what I  want something to look like like I've  got a general planning or you know this  is gonna be a village it's gonna look  this way and I want it to be exactly  this way there's gonna be the Town Hall  over here that's gonna be Church over  here and it's gonna look like this and  it's gonna be awesome and if you have  that kind of expectation of what you  want to do if you have a general idea  I'm planning  of what you're going to do it's much  easier to get that motivation because  you've got something to look forward to  like every single wall that you build  isn't just a random wall in the middle  of nowhere but this is gonna sound so  cheesy but it's it's a wall that you let  you place that is one step closer to  making what you are trying to make a  reality it's once more closer to making  that alpine village a reality with