 to make really helps me  going not just in terms of you know  keeping me building and interested in  actually working on what I'm building  but also it just makes the final results  more clear and well put together in many  of my cases and it just makes the game  more fun to play and yeah you will also  need some patience for it which is why I  wanted to talk about that for a second  as well I kept many questions about like  how I can even stand to play games like  this for four hours in a row and just  keep going with it then I was just about  to say that in day out but that's Dutch  saying that's terrible  but yeah how I keep going on like 24/7  playing games like this truth be told I  don't really I am pretty sure that there  are many people who do have that  patience but there are just certain ways  that you kinda have to get yourself  through it with I think sometimes if  you're really caught in that stream of  yes I'm gonna make this I'm gonna make  this happen you can play for hours on  end and just keep going without any  other real thing that's stimulating you  to do so but in many cases I think for  me personally because I'm not that's  patience it's nice to have something  aside that is also quite enjoyable so I  like to play the game while you know I'm  either playing with people though I  don't really do that as often with time  lapses I love playing the game while  listening to some good music for me this  is really important the music is  everything but you can also you know  take some breaks rarely any of my time  lapses are one single time lapse there's  sometimes recorded over multiple days  definitely multiple sessions on a day  and there's a bit of just well fun  playing around between these time lapses  as well it's definitely not just keep on  playing the game until you know I've got  that video out I think if you've got  something in the background like music  or just talking with people it can be  really relaxing kind of game to play and  th